- `<math>` puts us in MathML namespace.
- `<mtext>` is a MathML text integration point.
- `<table>` inside mtext... 
- `<mglyph>` is a MathML element that's a "special" element.
- `<style>` inside mglyph.
- The `<!--` starts a comment inside style.
- `</style>` closes the style.
- Then `<img title="-->` — the `-->` closes the comment.
- `<img src=1 onerror=...>` executes.

The mutation happens because the sanitizer's parse tree differs from the re-parse tree.

